[[Christien Meindertsma]] with [[Enkev]], Netherlands, 2015.

Flax fiber and [[PLA]] pressed into one flat panel. The seat is cut and molded from it. What's left over becomes the legs.

It can be shredded and pressed again. At the very end it can be composted.

The flax came from her Flax Project, which began when she bought a Dutch farm's whole harvest.
